'''Tracer''' is a [[Sub-Roles#Flanker|Flanker]] [[Roles#Damage|Damage]] [[Heroes|hero]] in ''[[Overwatch 2|Overwatch]]''. She is one of the 21 heroes included in the game's release on 24 May 2016.

==Overview==
[[File:Tracer HS.mp4|left|thumb]] Toting twin pulse pistols, energy-based time bombs, and rapid-fire banter, Tracer is able to "blink" through space and rewind her personal timeline as she battles to right wrongs the world over.

